    "en": "Municipality borders, attribute data includes the number and the name of the municipality, and data about the bigger administrative units the municipality belongs to. The sea areas have been deleted from this dataset by Kylli Ek (CSC), so that this dataset would fit better for thematic maps. Additionally this dataset has been saved from GML to Shape-format. \r\n\r\nCoordinate Reference System: ETRS89 / ETRS-TM35FIN (EPSG:3067)"
  },
